h1. User Story

*As a* business customer
*I want to* view the new Platinum Hub homepage
*So that* I can explore Platinum Business products and access role-specific features

h1. Design Reference

* Figma Design: [https://www.figma.com/design/Cs93FuqmqAv4Lf1T0cSCtP/Draft-Design?node-id=12839-28727&t=eotqDSINfZqiKeZZ-0]
* Icon Assets: [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16sGQPTdknTvWwcYvV9IMva16dMu4ut7p?usp=drive_link]

----

h1. Acceptance Criteria

h2. AC1: Page Layout and Branding

*Given* a user visits the Platinum Hub homepage
*When* the page loads
*Then* the following elements should be visible:
* IM3 Platinum Business Vertical logo in upper left corner
* "What is Platinum Business" section in left upper corner
* Header navigation with: Toko, Platinum Business, Academy, Wawasan
* Login button OR user icon (if authenticated) in header above banner
* Hero banner on upper right
* Footer with Indosat logo
* Contact email: {{platinumbusiness@ioh.co.id}} in footer
* Social media links pointing to IM3 official channels

h2. AC2: Product Display - Featured Products

*Given* a user views the homepage
*When* scrolling to the product section
*Then*:
* Display 4 featured Platinum Business Shared Quota products
* Each product card shows product name, description, and key features
* Products are displayed in a responsive grid layout
* "See All Products" button is visible below featured products

h2. AC3: Product Display - View All Products

*Given* a user clicks "See All Products" button
*When* the action completes
*Then*:
* Display all 13 Platinum Business Shared Quota products
* Maintain consistent product card design
* Allow filtering/sorting options
* Provide "Back" or collapse functionality

h2. AC4: Lead Generation Form

*Given* an unauthenticated user wants to inquire about products
*When* they fill and submit the lead generation form
*Then*:
* Form captures: Name, Company, Email, Phone, Message
* Form validation prevents submission with invalid/missing data
* Success message displays after submission
* Lead data is sent to admin portal leads section
* User receives confirmation email

h2. AC5: Authentication - Login Flow

*Given* an unauthenticated user
*When* they click the Login button in header
*Then*:
* Redirect to Auth0 login page
* After successful authentication, return to homepage
* Display user icon instead of Login button
* Store authentication token securely

h2. AC6: Navigation - Toko Link

*Given* any user (authenticated or not)
*When* clicking "Toko" in header
*Then*:
* Navigate to Toko Catalog page
* Maintain current authentication state
* No errors occur

h2. AC7: Navigation - Platinum Business Link (Unauthenticated)

*Given* an unauthenticated user
*When* clicking "Platinum Business" in header
*Then*:
* Display error message: "Please login to access Platinum Business"
* Do not navigate away from current page
* Highlight Login button

h2. AC8: Navigation - Platinum Business Link (Authenticated)

*Given* an authenticated user with role Admin
*When* clicking "Platinum Business" in header
*Then* navigate to Admin page

*Given* an authenticated user with role Sales
*When* clicking "Platinum Business" in header
*Then* navigate to Sales homepage

*Given* an authenticated user with role Customer
*When* clicking "Platinum Business" in header
*Then* navigate to Customer homepage

*Given* an authenticated user with role Verificator
*When* clicking "Platinum Business" in header
*Then* navigate to Verificator homepage

h2. AC9: Responsive Design

*Given* a user accesses the page on any device
*When* the viewport changes
*Then*:
* Layout adapts to mobile (320px-767px), tablet (768px-1023px), desktop (1024px+)
* Navigation collapses to hamburger menu on mobile
* Product grid adjusts columns based on screen size
* All interactive elements remain accessible
* Images scale appropriately without distortion

h2. AC10: Performance Requirements

*Given* a user loads the Platinum Hub homepage
*When* measured with Lighthouse/Web Vitals
*Then*:
* First Contentful Paint (FCP) < 1.5s
* Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) < 2.5s
* Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) < 0.1
* Time to Interactive (TTI) < 3.5s
* Total page size < 2MB

----

h1. Test Cases

h2. Positive Test Scenarios

*TC-01: Verify Homepage Loads Successfully*
* *Preconditions*: User has internet connection
* *Steps*:
*# Navigate to Platinum Hub URL
*# Wait for page load
* *Expected Result*: All sections render correctly within 3 seconds
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-02: Verify Header Navigation Elements*
* *Steps*:
*# Load homepage
*# Verify IM3 Platinum logo presence
*# Verify navigation items: Toko, Platinum Business, Academy, Wawasan
*# Verify Login button/User icon
* *Expected Result*: All elements visible and correctly positioned
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-03: Verify Featured Products Display*
* *Steps*:
*# Scroll to product section
*# Count visible product cards
* *Expected Result*: Exactly 4 products displayed with complete information
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-04: Verify See All Products Functionality*
* *Steps*:
*# Click "See All Products" button
*# Count total products displayed
* *Expected Result*: 13 products shown with consistent layout
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-05: Verify Lead Form Submission (Valid Data)*
* *Steps*:
*# Fill form with valid data
*# Submit form
*# Check admin portal
* *Expected Result*: Lead created in admin portal, success message shown
* *Automation*: PARTIAL (UI automation only, admin verification manual)

*TC-06: Verify Login Flow*
* *Steps*:
*# Click Login button
*# Complete Auth0 authentication
*# Return to homepage
* *Expected Result*: User icon replaces Login button, authentication token stored
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-07: Verify Role-Based Navigation - Admin*
* *Preconditions*: Logged in as Admin
* *Steps*:
*# Click "Platinum Business" link
* *Expected Result*: Navigate to Admin page
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-08: Verify Role-Based Navigation - Sales*
* *Preconditions*: Logged in as Sales
* *Steps*:
*# Click "Platinum Business" link
* *Expected Result*: Navigate to Sales homepage
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-09: Verify Role-Based Navigation - Customer*
* *Preconditions*: Logged in as Customer
* *Steps*:
*# Click "Platinum Business" link
* *Expected Result*: Navigate to Customer homepage
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-10: Verify Role-Based Navigation - Verificator*
* *Preconditions*: Logged in as Verificator
* *Steps*:
*# Click "Platinum Business" link
* *Expected Result*: Navigate to Verificator homepage
* *Automation*: YES

h2. Negative Test Scenarios

*TC-11: Verify Platinum Business Link Without Authentication*
* *Preconditions*: Not logged in
* *Steps*:
*# Click "Platinum Business" link
* *Expected Result*: Error message "Please login to access Platinum Business" displayed
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-12: Verify Lead Form Validation - Missing Required Fields*
* *Steps*:
*# Leave Name field empty
*# Submit form
* *Expected Result*: Validation error displayed, form not submitted
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-13: Verify Lead Form Validation - Invalid Email*
* *Steps*:
*# Enter invalid email format
*# Submit form
* *Expected Result*: Email validation error displayed
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-14: Verify Lead Form Validation - Invalid Phone*
* *Steps*:
*# Enter letters in phone field
*# Submit form
* *Expected Result*: Phone validation error displayed
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-15: Verify Navigation with Network Failure*
* *Steps*:
*# Simulate network disconnect
*# Click navigation links
* *Expected Result*: Appropriate error message, no app crash
* *Automation*: YES

h2. Boundary Value Tests

*TC-16: Verify Lead Form - Minimum Field Lengths*
* *Steps*:
*# Enter 1 character in Name field
*# Submit form
* *Expected Result*: Validation error if minimum not met
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-17: Verify Lead Form - Maximum Field Lengths*
* *Steps*:
*# Enter 500 characters in Message field
*# Submit form
* *Expected Result*: Accept up to max limit, truncate beyond
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-18: Verify Viewport at Breakpoints*
* *Steps*:
*# Test at 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1920px widths
* *Expected Result*: Layout adapts correctly at each breakpoint
* *Automation*: YES

h2. Security Tests

*TC-19: Verify XSS Prevention in Lead Form*
* *Steps*:
*# Enter {{<script>alert('XSS')</script>}} in form fields
*# Submit form
* *Expected Result*: Input sanitized, no script execution
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-20: Verify CSRF Protection*
* *Steps*:
*# Attempt form submission without CSRF token
* *Expected Result*: Request rejected
* *Automation*: PARTIAL

*TC-21: Verify Authentication Token Security*
* *Steps*:
*# Login and inspect token storage
* *Expected Result*: Token stored in httpOnly cookie or secure storage
* *Automation*: PARTIAL

h2. Performance Tests

*TC-22: Verify Page Load Performance*
* *Steps*:
*# Run Lighthouse audit
*# Check Core Web Vitals
* *Expected Result*: LCP < 2.5s, FID < 100ms, CLS < 0.1
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-23: Verify Concurrent User Load*
* *Steps*:
*# Simulate 100 concurrent users
*# Monitor response times
* *Expected Result*: Page loads successfully, response time < 3s
* *Automation*: YES (load testing tool)

h2. Accessibility Tests

*TC-24: Verify Keyboard Navigation*
* *Steps*:
*# Use Tab to navigate all interactive elements
*# Use Enter/Space to activate buttons
* *Expected Result*: All elements accessible via keyboard
* *Automation*: PARTIAL

*TC-25: Verify Screen Reader Compatibility*
* *Steps*:
*# Use screen reader to navigate page
* *Expected Result*: All content properly announced
* *Automation*: NO (manual testing required)

*TC-26: Verify Color Contrast*
* *Steps*:
*# Check all text against backgrounds
* *Expected Result*: Minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio for normal text
* *Automation*: YES

h2. Integration Tests

*TC-27: Verify Lead Data in Admin Portal*
* *Steps*:
*# Submit lead form
*# Login to admin portal
*# Check leads section
* *Expected Result*: Lead appears with correct data
* *Automation*: PARTIAL

*TC-28: Verify Social Media Link Redirects*
* *Steps*:
*# Click each social media icon
* *Expected Result*: Opens correct IM3 social media page
* *Automation*: YES

*TC-29: Verify Toko Catalog Navigation*
* *Steps*:
*# Click Toko link
* *Expected Result*: Navigate to Toko catalog page
* *Automation*: YES

h2. Regression Tests

*TC-30: Verify Existing Auth0 Integration*
* *Steps*:
*# Test login flow with existing users
* *Expected Result*: Authentication works as before
* *Automation*: YES

h2. Playwright Automation Examples

{code:typescript}
// TC-01: Homepage Load Test
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';

test('Platinum Hub homepage loads successfully', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  // Verify key elements
  await expect(page.locator('header')).toBeVisible();
  await expect(page.locator('text=What is Platinum Business')).toBeVisible();
  await expect(page.locator('.product-section')).toBeVisible();
  await expect(page.locator('footer')).toBeVisible();

  // Performance check
  const performance = await page.evaluate(() => 
    JSON.stringify(window.performance.timing)
  );
  console.log('Performance metrics:', performance);
});

// TC-03: Featured Products Display
test('displays 4 featured products', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  const productCards = page.locator('.product-card');
  await expect(productCards).toHaveCount(4);

  // Verify each product has required elements
  for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
    const card = productCards.nth(i);
    await expect(card.locator('.product-name')).toBeVisible();
    await expect(card.locator('.product-description')).toBeVisible();
  }
});

// TC-04: See All Products
test('see all products shows 13 products', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  await page.click('text=See All Products');
  await page.waitForLoadState('networkidle');

  const allProducts = page.locator('.product-card');
  await expect(allProducts).toHaveCount(13);
});

// TC-11: Unauthenticated Platinum Business Access
test('shows error when accessing Platinum Business without login', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  await page.click('nav a:has-text("Platinum Business")');

  await expect(page.locator('.error-message')).toContainText(
    'Please login to access Platinum Business'
  );

  // Verify still on homepage
  await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\/platinum-hub/);
});

// TC-05: Lead Form Submission
test('submits lead form with valid data', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  await page.fill('input[name="name"]', 'John Doe');
  await page.fill('input[name="company"]', 'Acme Corp');
  await page.fill('input[name="email"]', 'john@example.com');
  await page.fill('input[name="phone"]', '081234567890');
  await page.fill('textarea[name="message"]', 'Interested in Platinum Business');

  await page.click('button[type="submit"]');

  await expect(page.locator('.success-message')).toBeVisible();
  await expect(page.locator('.success-message')).toContainText(
    'Thank you for your interest'
  );
});

// TC-12: Form Validation
test('shows validation errors for empty required fields', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  await page.click('button[type="submit"]');

  await expect(page.locator('.error-name')).toBeVisible();
  await expect(page.locator('.error-email')).toBeVisible();
  await expect(page.locator('.error-phone')).toBeVisible();
});

// TC-07: Role-Based Navigation - Admin
test('admin user navigates to admin page', async ({ page }) => {
  // Login as admin
  await page.goto('/login');
  await page.fill('input[name="email"]', 'admin@test.com');
  await page.fill('input[name="password"]', 'password123');
  await page.click('button[type="submit"]');

  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');
  await page.click('nav a:has-text("Platinum Business")');

  await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\/admin/);
});

// TC-18: Responsive Design
test('layout adapts to different viewports', async ({ page }) => {
  const viewports = [
    { width: 320, height: 568, name: 'Mobile' },
    { width: 768, height: 1024, name: 'Tablet' },
    { width: 1920, height: 1080, name: 'Desktop' }
  ];

  for (const viewport of viewports) {
    await page.setViewportSize({ 
      width: viewport.width, 
      height: viewport.height 
    });

    await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

    // Verify header is visible
    await expect(page.locator('header')).toBeVisible();

    // Check if hamburger menu appears on mobile
    if (viewport.width < 768) {
      await expect(page.locator('.hamburger-menu')).toBeVisible();
    }
  }
});

// TC-22: Performance Metrics
test('page meets performance benchmarks', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/platinum-hub');

  const performanceMetrics = await page.evaluate(() => {
    const navigation = performance.getEntriesByType('navigation')[0];
    return {
      domContentLoaded: navigation.domContentLoadedEventEnd - navigation.domContentLoadedEventStart,
      loadComplete: navigation.loadEventEnd - navigation.loadEventStart,
      responseTime: navigation.responseEnd - navigation.requestStart
    };
  });

  expect(performanceMetrics.responseTime).toBeLessThan(1500);
  expect(performanceMetrics.loadComplete).toBeLessThan(3500);
});
{code}

